{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんわかつき。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前髪ぱっつんでーす。が、もう伸びました。\n私の髪に持続性は皆無です。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2015/09/10/9612527/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わかまな(∗ˊ꒳ˋ∗)❤︎\nいつも一緒にいる気がするし、\nとりあえず価値観とか話がメンバー1合う人。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2015/09/10/9612527/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひらりーと(∗ˊ꒳ˋ∗)！！めっちゃ話しやすくて\n初対面だったのにすぐ仲良くなりました＊\n今度御飯いきましょー！可愛い！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2015/09/10/9612527/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"既に懐かしい神宮の1枚。まいちゃん❤︎\n楽屋の席がお隣でしたん！！だいすき"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2015/09/10/9612527/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さぁ、今週末は久々の握手会だっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山、沢山 お話があるね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もしよかったら12thの握手会は会えないよって方とか、むしろ12thも行くよって方も\n13th会いに来てね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2015/09/10/9612527/0004.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}